# Use the PUBLIC npm registry for this repo, overriding the global corporate proxy
# (a Serpro Nexus in ~/.npmrc) that is slow and lags on new versions. vault-seed consumes
# public @refarm.dev packages (vendored locally as `file:` tarballs from the refarm handoff)
# plus ordinary public deps — it has no need of the private mirror. A developer's global
# config (for other/work repos) stays untouched. Override with `npm_config_registry=` if needed.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
